  "details": "Custom statuses can extend past the borders of nameplates if you teleport far away and back when with other users because of how nameplates are shrunken when far away and also because you instantly bypass the distance needed for custom statuses to disappear from nameplates completely. The issue fixes itself if you open and close the QM. \"Status Shown\" always selected as well.\nVideo: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pjiCLiF3SBn0jDRzPeqtcFv4dfOaCZUD/view?usp=sharing",
